And so, the magic truly begins, for even before the famous[ stunt] takes place we see an ultra-rare Cortina[ Estate] with a Webasto[ roof], the BSA Lightning and the incredible Rolls-Roy[ce] camera car. In the background are Vaux[hall] Viva HAs[, Jaguar] Mk.2s[,] Morris 1100[s,] Renault 4s[,] Peugeot[ 404s and a] Commer Walk-Th[ru catering] van.
